---
pagination:
  data: pages.faq.locales
  size: 1
  alias: locale
permalink: "{{ locale.permalink }}"
---
{#
  TAQATHON - FAQ PAGE TEMPLATE (src/pages/faq.njk)
  ----------------------------------------------------
  Identical accordion pattern to src/pages/rules.njk — one loop over
  locale.content.sections instead of hand-typed accordion-item blocks
  per question. Kept as its own template file (not a variant of
  rules.njk) to match this site's one-file-per-page convention, even
  though the markup is the same shape.

  PLACEHOLDER CONTENT (Phase 2, 2026-08-11): every question/answer in
  faq.ar.json / faq.en.json is a generic stand-in — see those files'
  "_comment" field. No visible on-page warning banner here (unlike
  Registration) since generic FAQ questions don't risk being mistaken
  for a real commitment the way a fake deadline or track name would;
  still, don't treat this content as final.

  TO CUSTOMIZE:
    - Add/remove/reorder a question → edit "sections" in the copy
      JSON files, same as Rules.
#}
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}
{% block pageStyle %}{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<main class="py-5">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:980px;">

    <div class="text-center mb-4">
      <div class="icon-circle mx-auto mb-3">
        <i class="bi {{ locale.content.hero.icon }}"></i>
      </div>
      <h5 class="mb-1 {{ locale.content.hero.headingClass }}">{{ locale.content.hero.heading }}</h5>
      <p class="text-secondary mb-0">
        {{ locale.content.hero.intro }}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
      {% for s in locale.content.sections %}
      <div class="accordion-item card-lite rounded-2xl mb-3 overflow-hidden">
        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="heading-{{ s.slug }}">
          <button class="accordion-button{% if not s.expanded %} collapsed{% endif %} fw-semibold" type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#collapse-{{ s.slug }}"
                  aria-expanded="{{ 'true' if s.expanded else 'false' }}"
                  aria-controls="collapse-{{ s.slug }}">
            {{ s.heading }}
          </button>
        </h2>
        <div id="collapse-{{ s.slug }}" class="accordion-collapse collapse{% if s.expanded %} show{% endif %}"
             aria-labelledby="heading-{{ s.slug }}" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
          <div class="accordion-body">
            {{ s.bodyHtml | safe }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

  </div>
</main>
{% endblock %}
